      "after": "Dh2  4.Le5  Dh3+  5.Lg3  Kd2\n\nKd5 9.Dc4+ en mat.\n\nDeze studie was de basis voor de\nuitbreiding van [de vorige studie](study:94).\nAls motivatie voor de 3de prijs gaf\nJulien Vandiest deze uitleg:\n\n“So there are 3 moves more…\nCoinnoisseurs will readely confirm\nit: knitting a (correct) extension to\na mininiature handling Queens is\nextremely  difficult. Moreover, the\nawarded study conceals some in-\nsidious  tries. The whole  of the\nwinning manoeuvre exhibits a re-\nfined series of moves, honouring\nthe consumer’s point of vieuw”.",
